  "1.16.5":{
    "1.9.0-alpha+20220726-2338":"Loads of new features",
    "1.8.10":"- Fix blood value loading for MCA and others\n- Make sure bees cannot eliminate DBNO vampires\n- Fix hissing sound playback\n- Allow village golems to ignore disguises\n- Clarify hunter disguise description\n- Add JEI click area for potion table\n- Clean up SpawnNewVillager event API",
    "1.8.1":"- Fix crash with Just Enough Resources. No reason to update otherwise.",
    "1.8.0":"Release of 1.8",
    "1.8.0-beta.4":"- Fix potential crash with balance modifiers (GodlyVampirism)\n- Render second skin layer for basic hunters\n- Add faction log marker\n- Fix unique tasks (e.g. lord) not being acceptable after timeout\n- Allow zero weight for forest biome\n- Fix crash related to hunter minion skin\n- Migrate to official Mojang mappings\n- Fix feeding adapter quest not recognizing imob hunter kills",
    "1.8.0-beta.3":"- IMPORTANT: All world gen related config is now in COMMON config. Old values elsewhere are ignored.\nThis affects biome and mob spawn rates, hunter tent separation and village separation\n- Refined commands\n- Update GuideBook for 1.8\n- New hunter textures by Random2325\n- Allow naturally generated villages be enlarged (when vampirism villages)\n- Allow floating point values for skillPointsPerLevel\n- Don't show accessory slots for hunters\n",
    "1.8.0-beta.2":"- A lot. Check the download page or Discord",
    "1.7.12":"- Fix crash with Taterzens",
    "1.7.11":"- Finally fix advanced vampire entities only having 1 health",
    "1.7.10":"- Stop vampires from converting or killing villagers\n- Fix grinder item tooltips\n- Reduce vampire hiss volume and frequency\n- Fix normal garlic beacon tile entity not working\n- Fix cloak clipping through player\n- Workaround for FastWorkbench & doLimitedCrafting\n- Add temporary workaround for world breaking issue with cauldron recipes likely caused by another mod\n- Fix resource pack id",
    "1.7.9":"- Derp",
    "1.7.8":"- Fix bell related crash\n- Fix totem related crash\n- Prevent drinking from stacked bottles\n- Stop hunter minions from defending against human players\n- Allow vampires to spawn in villages for performance reasons\n- New book and binding textures by DimensionPainter\n- New obsidian armor texture by MrVityaTrash\n- Don't make harmful drinkable hunter potions deadly",
    "1.7.7":"- Fix totem top drop\n- Fix several tent related issues. Thereby increasing advanced hunter (re)spawn rate\n- Fix cooldown when prematurely disabling an action\n- Adjust certain command permissions\n- Allow drinking pure blood for food at higher levels
- Collect blood now also yields resources. Adjusted resources\n- Allow select action screen to also bind mouse keys\n- Fix vampire dungeon regeneration\n- Reduce food level and add nausea for eating human hearts as non vampire",
    "1.7.6":"- Fix crash with dimension mods\n- Fix automatic blood value calculation\n- Remove some of the stronger resistance potions\n- Slightly nerf some other hunter potions\n- Fix/adjust structure density for camps and villages",
    "1.7.5":"- Ringing a bell will now highlight all entities of the opposite faction during a village capture\n- Reset lord tasks when changing lord level\n- Some new textures by Alis\n- Only loose one lord level when resetting skills as lord\n- Make hunter brewed potions lethal to non hunters\n- Fix title gender resetting upon death and not updating on setting gender\n- Fix explosions not fully destroying tents\n- Fix crash with hunter potion resistance\n- Fix and cleanup configurations\n- Fix crash when having Optifine in server mod directory\n- Fix error with some entities while saving the world\n- Enforce tent generation for datapack worlds\n- Cleanup API setup",
    "1.7.4":"- Skip rendering bottom part of screen overlay when using Optifine+Shaders\n- Fix issue with CraftTweaker\n- Fix rare mod compatibility issue on world creation\n- Update Chinese Simplified translations thanks to @zorc\n- Avoid potential mod mixin conflict",
    "1.7.3":"- Add workaround for issue on world load or respawn caused by Optifine (no levels, no bloodbar, no skills, etc.. )\n- Fix/Improve certain rendering issues with Optifine + Shaders: Screen border should work. Blood vision should not crash anything.\n- Depending on the shader blood vision might add glowing affect to entities\n- Fix hunter disguise functionality: Mobs should have a significantly decreased detection range again\n- Make minions with locked task ignore the call all command\n- Migrate some coremods to mixins\n- Fix stake not affecting vampire players\n- Balance villager trades\n- Avoid issue with vampire swords not training\n- Change structure separation registration to fix hunter tents not generating with TerraForged\n- Fix efficient brewing\n- Add biome types to forest. Fixes biome gen with certain modded world generators\n- Allow converting cursed earth to regular grass using holy water bottles\n- Allow configuring number of minions a player unlocks per lord level\n- Fix weapon table and alchemical cauldron skill requirement rendering"
  },
  "1.16.4":{
