    "1.7.7":"- Fix totem top drop\n- Fix several tent related issues. Thereby increasing advanced hunter (re)spawn rate\n- Fix cooldown when prematurely disabling an action\n- Adjust certain command permissions\n- Allow drinking pure blood for food at higher levels
