    "1.7.4":"- Skip rendering bottom part of screen overlay when using Optifine+Shaders\n- Fix issue with CraftTweaker\n- Fix rare mod compatibility issue on world creation\n- Update Chinese Simplified translations thanks to @zorc\n- Avoid potential mod mixin conflict",
    "1.7.3":"- Add workaround for issue on world load or respawn caused by Optifine (no levels, no bloodbar, no skills, etc.. )\n- Fix/Improve certain rendering issues with Optifine + Shaders: Screen border should work. Blood vision should not crash anything.\n- Depending on the shader blood vision might add glowing affect to entities\n- Fix hunter disguise functionality: Mobs should have a significantly decreased detection range again\n- Make minions with locked task ignore the call all command\n- Migrate some coremods to mixins\n- Fix stake not affecting vampire players\n- Balance villager trades\n- Avoid issue with vampire swords not training\n- Change structure separation registration to fix hunter tents not generating with TerraForged\n- Fix efficient brewing\n- Add biome types to forest. Fixes biome gen with certain modded world generators\n- Allow converting cursed earth to regular grass using holy water bottles\n- Allow configuring number of minions a player unlocks per lord level\n- Fix weapon table and alchemical cauldron skill requirement rendering",
    "1.7.2":"- Rework balance config system to allow addons to modify the default values (should have no effect for users)\n- Fix certain configuration not being considered at all (most mob properties, hunter attack speed skills, vampire blood thirst and sundamage reduction skill, vampire speed boost skill)\n- Fix log spam with certain mods\n- Add garlic as loot to some chests\n- Add missing glowing eye option to player appearance screen\n- Improve guide book text on vampire blood and vampire baron\n- Fix missing hunter table structure notice\n- Fix misleading hunter trainer response\n- Allow configuring maximum yellow screen percentage, skillPointsPerLevel and alloInfiniteSpecialArrows",
    "1.7.1":"- Fix sundamage configuration not working\n- Fix mod compat related crash on world creation\n- Adjust vampire/fire related default configuration if IceAndFire is loadeed\n- Add small cooldown between action hotkey activation\n- Fix/Cleanup several parts of code to make it less error prone\n- Fix API issue",
    "1.7.0":"- All changes from previous betas/alphas\n- Fix minions sometimes not following/teleporting\n- Print dead/recovering minions when trying to recall them\n- Don't show an empty select single minion GUI when all minions are dead\n- Fix minion health",
    "1.7.0-beta.2":"- Fix crash with Astral Sorcery\n- Fix reordering action menu\n- Fix hunter table recipe book\n- Gui related fixes",
    "1.7.0-beta.1":"- Buff obsidian armor to include knockback resistance and make it inflammable\n- Properly mark vampire firedamage as firedamage\n- Refresh player chat name on lord level change\n- Improve logs",
    "1.6.3":"- Fix crash with Minecolonies",
    "1.6.2":"- Fix hunters running away\n- Remove rain from vampire forest"
